00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:11.740
"Now the Earth Awakens"

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.530
The sea is in blue slumber,

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.530
Umi wa aoku nemuri

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.120
Life is blooming on the land,

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.120
Daichi ni inochi mebae

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.250
And the sky, and the sky

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.250
Soshite sora ga soshite sora ga

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.620
dreams of tomorrow.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.620
Ashita o yume mite

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.250
Look, the reborn Earth

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.250
Hora umarekawatta chikyuu ga

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:35.510
welcomes the awakening morning.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:35.510
Mezame no asa o mukaeru

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:42.810
Swim, make waves! Run, kick up the soil!

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:42.810
Oyoge nami ketate hashire tsuchi o keri

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:48.650
Because you love the Earth so much,

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:48.650
Konnani chikyuu ga suki dakara

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:56.910
Because the dawn is so beautiful!

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:56.910
Konnani yoake ga utsukushii kara

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:04.040
Sing, add your voice! Dance, join your arms!

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:04.040
Utae koe awase odore kata o kumi

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.880
Because you love the Earth so much,

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.880
Konnani chikyuu ga suki dakara

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:18.390
Because the dawn is so beautiful!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:18.390
Konnani yoake ga utsukushii kara

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:19.760
Planning

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:19.760
Nippon Animation

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:45.120
<i>July, 2008 A.D.</i>

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:48.420
<i>Mankind was facing a crisis that threatened extinction.</i>

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:51.030
<i>Supermagnetic weapons far more destructive than nuclear weapons</i>

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:54.760
<i>caused half the world to be wiped out in an instant.</i>

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:12.880
<i>The Earth was seized by great tectonic upheavals, and its axis twisted.</i>

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.900
<i>The five continents were completely ripped apart and sank into the sea. {time check, lead-out}</i>

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:57.570
Remnant Island

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.340
Twenty years have already passed since

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:23.420
our spaceship crash-landed on this island. {time check, subtitle ends too early}

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:27.760
The destruction wrought by the war that foolish mankind brought about

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:31.140
reduced the Earth to a shadow of its former glory, {time check it please}

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:37.070
but now vegetation grows thickly and nature undergoes a beautiful revival.

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:43.910
However, my companions from the spaceship have died off one after another...

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.200
and I, too, have already grown old.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:52.510
I wonder if other humans besides us survive on this Earth. {time check}

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:54.330
Grandpa!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.660
Grandpa!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.090
Grandpa!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.430
Look, that lousy Whitenose has shown up!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.510
He killed almost all the fish in the preserve!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.660
I'll get him today for sure.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.400
Conan, take it easy!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.440
Got him! {yatta!} {this subtitle isn't showing up, any reason why?}

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.660
I did it!

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:42.790
I did it!  I did it!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.290
I did it, Grandpa!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.170
Hurray!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.330
O-o-omigosh! {TL Check, line is similar to the next}

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.540
Emergency!  Emergency!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.030
It moved!  It moved!  It moved!  It moved!

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:20.100
What's the matter?  Are you sleeping there because you're hungry?

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:34.360
Grandpa!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.080
Grandpa!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.030
Emergency!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.410
Grandpa!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:47.870
Oh, he finally got Whitenose, eh?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:54.130
There's a person sleeping on the beach!  Come quickly!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:54.920
What!?

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.880
It's a person!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:56.760
Are they alive!?

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.880
He moved, but he went back to sleep again! {He? Does Conan really say this?}

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.260
Hurry!  Hurry, Grandpa!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.690
W-water...

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.450
Go get water!  Quickly!

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.320
Water... water...

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.120
Hurry!

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.460
Ow! {time check this one, he screams a bit early}

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:53.470
H-hey, drink a little more slowly, eh?  Keep it up like that and you'll pass out.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.950
Conan, bring something to eat.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.620
Ow-w-w!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.990
F-food...

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.000
Where am I?

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.770
Don't worry.  You're in my hut.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:26.750
Is this High Harbor?  Or is it Industria?

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.680
It isn't High Harbor, is it?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:37.440
This is Remnant Island.  That's what we call it anyway.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:42.810
Is there someone called Dr. Briac Lao on this island?

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:47.830
There's no one on this island besides me and Conan.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.120
Here, food!

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:03.640
No, no!  Something softer... There, that soup!

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.600
Young miss, please tell me...

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:20.480
are there people besides us and you who survive on this planet?

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:25.150
I see.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.240
I'm so glad...

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.490
It isn't just us.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.170
Here, eat this. {You drink soup in Japanese, but you eat it in English.}

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:42.920
Oh, before that you should change out of those wet clothes.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.800
I'll lend you one of my shirts.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.220
Conan, go outside.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:51.220
Why?  I want to be here.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.970
It doesn't matter why.  Now, out with you!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.290
Hey, no peeping! {He says Conan's name right? Confirm this please}

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.050
Woah!  Ow!

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.000
Conan.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.840
Here, go wash these.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.850
It smells funny!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.230
It smells funny!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:49.190
Please forgive him.  He's never seen anyone other than me, much less a girl. {XXX}

