00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:23.900
CONAN

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.330
Is she alive?

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.040
It's all right.  She's alive.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.300
Should I try poking her a little?

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.490
Get out!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.010
I won't tell you!  Get out!

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:55.600
What should we do?  Get out?

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:59.010
She doesn't mean us; she's talking in her sleep.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:03.010
Grandfather?  Grandfather, where are you?

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:13.540
Don't worry.  I'm right here. {XXX}

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:22.910
Grandpa...

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.710
Poor thing.  It seems she's been treated very badly, {time check}

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:31.180
though I couldn't ask her about the details... {time check}

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:53.650
Grandpa... {time check, more lead-out problems}

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:56.450
Is she alive? {time check, lead-in is early}

00:16:56.860 --> 00:17:00.200
She's fine.  Don't worry and go to sleep.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:01.490
OK. {timing, lead-out is off}

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:04.700
Good night. {timing, lead-out is off}

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:16.780
I see.

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.070
Thank you.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:37.760
Good morning.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.680
Were you talking to the birds?

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.970
No, but my heart understands them.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.350
I call this tern "Tikki".

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:47.880
He's my friend.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:53.150
Really!  That's why it called me, saying "She is here"!

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:54.610
"She"? {Her sounds bad. How about she? Tell me what you think. See the line above as well.}

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:58.860
Yeah, Grandpa, uh...

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:04.610
He said, "It's not a 'him', call her 'her'"!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.130
I'm Lana.  My name is Lana.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:13.130
Laa... La-na... Lana!

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.790
Thank you for saving me.

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:20.590
I'm Conan.  My name is Conan!

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:22.970
Lana, huh?

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:28.100
It's just you and your grandfather on this island?

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:33.600
Nope.  I hear there were more before, but they all died. {XXX}

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.100
I see...

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.320
There's a graveyard.  Wanna go see?

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:39.980
Later, OK?

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:42.320
Conan.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.410
Are there any ships?  Ships that can go to distant islands?

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.580
Yeah, there is!  I use it when I'm fishing!

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:50.330
Over here!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.590
You're right.  It's a cute boat.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.840
But it couldn't go to High Harbor.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.590
High Harbor?

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.600
The island where I was born.  There are lots of people there!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.800
There are people besides you, Lana?

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:10.800
Yes, it's full of them - children and grownups.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.820
This many?

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.950
Nope, more!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.980
Then... this many?

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:22.570
Nope, much more!

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:25.790
There are hundreds of people!

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.780
That many!?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:36.170
High Harbor is an island much, much bigger than this one.

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:57.400
It's a place where the old villages weren't sunk under the sea.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.730
They stayed as they were, even in the time of the Great Disaster.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:05.280
There are wide open fields and pastures, green forests, hills where the flowers are always in bloom,

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.030
and many fruit trees.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.660
It's a very pretty island.

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:23.840
You want to go home?

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:25.550
Yes.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.220
There's fruit on this island, too!

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:33.770
Let's go!  There!

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.320
Here we go!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.060
No!  I'm scared!

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:41.110
You're light, Lana!  Like a bird!

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:43.020
The-e-ere we go-o-o!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.030
Wooooah!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:48.030
Heh, just kidding!

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:49.030
Goodness!

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:58.210
Can you really eat the fruit?

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.550
It's really good!  Here!

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:07.010
Good, ain't it?

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:09.050
It's sour!

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:15.190
Yum!

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:29.160
A bird!

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:30.280
Hide!

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:39.170
It's not a bird, it's a hydroplane.  From Industria!

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:41.250
Industria?

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:44.170
They're bad people!  They've come looking for me!

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:46.300
For you, Lana?

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:00.480
What the... A hydroplane!?

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:05.890
He-e-ey!  He-e-ey!

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:47.770
What have you come to this island for?

00:23:48.980 --> 00:23:51.490
Well, now.  So you remember how to speak?

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:57.240
We're searching for a young girl called Lana.  Has she come to this island?

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:02.250
I don't know.  I haven't seen any such girl!

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:04.960
We'll check out the hut!

00:24:15.050 --> 00:24:17.180
They're going into the hut!  With Grandpa, too!

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:19.430
I wonder if your grandfather will be all right.

00:24:20.640 --> 00:24:23.020
You hide here, Lana.  I'll go take a look.

00:24:23.890 --> 00:24:25.020
Be careful!

00:24:27.730 --> 00:24:30.480
Hmph!  This hut reeks of fish!

00:24:32.190 --> 00:24:33.320
She's not in here.

00:24:35.820 --> 00:24:38.870
Gather all inhabitants of the island here!

00:24:38.870 --> 00:24:40.450
Do as you're ordered, old man!

00:24:41.790 --> 00:24:44.870
You're still doing these sorts of things?

00:24:45.880 --> 00:24:48.250
Waving guns and such around. {XXX}

00:24:48.960 --> 00:24:53.050
You didn't learn anything from the Great Disaster, did you?

00:24:53.840 --> 00:24:54.970
What's with you, old man?

00:24:55.260 --> 00:24:59.890
That way of thinking destroyed the world!  Don't you understand that!?

00:25:00.140 --> 00:25:05.390
What are you saying!?  You were the adults then; you started that war!

00:25:07.730 --> 00:25:10.150
We were still children!

00:25:10.150 --> 00:25:14.240
Do you even understand the painful experiences we went through as children,

00:25:14.240 --> 00:25:15.410
just to survive?

00:25:15.820 --> 00:25:19.400
As one of the irresponsible adults who started the war and

00:25:19.780 --> 00:25:22.950
have been reduced to savages, you've no right to talk!

00:25:26.120 --> 00:25:27.750
Now, do as you are told!

00:25:41.970 --> 00:25:43.260
What's the matter?

00:25:45.810 --> 00:25:46.980
Leave!

00:25:46.980 --> 00:25:49.610
If you don't want to die, leave this island!

00:25:54.030 --> 00:25:58.880
Stop it!  If you fire that thing, you'll die as well!

00:25:59.370 --> 00:26:00.910
Leave!

00:26:02.200 --> 00:26:04.550
Leave this island!

00:26:05.930 --> 00:26:08.490
Don't ever show your faces here again!

00:26:08.570 --> 00:26:10.460
Dammit!

00:26:10.460 --> 00:26:14.550
Talking to him is out of the question.  Let's go, Kuzu.

00:26:14.550 --> 00:26:16.460
You can suit yourself and rot on this island!

00:26:25.560 --> 00:26:26.270
Grandpa!!

00:26:26.480 --> 00:26:27.730
Get away!!

00:26:46.500 --> 00:26:48.250
Grandpa!  Hang in there!

00:26:48.330 --> 00:26:53.750
I'm all right.  Conan, protect the girl.

00:26:54.280 --> 00:26:55.050
OK.

00:26:55.380 --> 00:26:56.620
Conan!

00:27:01.100 --> 00:27:03.560
Conan!

00:27:12.650 --> 00:27:14.440
Conan!

00:27:28.120 --> 00:27:28.920
Conan!

00:27:29.160 --> 00:27:31.170
Give Lana back!

00:27:41.630 --> 00:27:45.640
Future Boy

00:27:41.630 --> 00:27:45.640
CONAN

00:27:46.470 --> 00:27:51.640
Be sure to join us for our next episode: "Setting Off"

